{
  "manufacturer": "Mitsubishi Electric",
  "manufacturer_slug": "mitsubishi-electric",
  "model": "AE-200J / AE-50J / EW-50J BACnet (Japan)",
  "model_slug": "ae-200j-ae-50j-ew-50j-japan",
  "aliases": [
    "AE-200J",
    "AE-50J",
    "EW-50J",
    "AE-200J BACnet",
    "三菱電機 AE-200J BACnet機能"
  ],
  "equipment_type": "VRF central controller with BACnet IP",
  "applies_to": "Japan-market CITY MULTI building air conditioning groups, Lossnay ventilators, DT-R, hot water heat pumps and brine coolers managed by an AE-200J, AE-50J or EW-50J.",
  "summary": "The AE-200J, AE-50J and EW-50J are the Japan-only central controllers for Mitsubishi Electric commercial air conditioning. With the BACnet license they act as a BACnet IP server and create a fixed set of objects per group, plus blocks for fire control, power-cut recovery, energy apportioning and DT-R / hot water heat pump / brine cooler systems. The manual is in Japanese and the object names are printed in Japanese; the English descriptions are ours. Objects only exist for the functions the connected unit type supports.",
  "bacnet_transport": [
    "BACnet IP"
  ],
  "firmware": null,
  "default_device_instance": null,
  "access_inferred": true,
  "notes": [
    "Instance = 6 digits CC NN PP: CC = object class + fixed 1 (01 group, 21 fire control, 31 power-cut, 41 measuring controller, 61 interlocked unit, 71 DT-R/brine cooler system, 91 DT-R unit), NN = group (or unit/system) number 01-50, 99 = all, PP = point. This list shows number 01 (010101 = 10101).",
    "Fire control state is MI 21ff00 where ff is the fire program number 01-05 or 99; program 01 is shown (210100).",
    "Hot water heat pumps and brine coolers reuse the DT-R objects (71tt / 91uu); the manual prints alternate names for them, and the BACnet setting tool shows the DT-R names.",
    "Access is inferred from object type; the manual gives WriteProperty support per object type, not per object.",
    "Calendar, Schedule, Device and Notification Class objects use configurable instance numbers and are not listed.",
    "Japan-market product. The international AE-C400 / EW-C50 BACnet objects are a separate list."
  ],
  "source": {
    "title": "三菱電機空調冷熱総合管理システム AE-200J/AE-50J/EW-50J 取扱説明書 BACnet機能編",
